---
// Hero section component - Software Engineering & Agile Methodology
---

<header
    id="inicio"
    class="relative bg-navy-900 text-white py-24 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden"
>
    <!-- Background Overlay/Image -->
    <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[url('/images/hero-bg.png')] bg-cover bg-center"
    >
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy-900/90 via-navy-900/80 to-navy-900"></div>
    </div>

    <div
        class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center"
    >
        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl">
            <div
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest mb-2"
            >
                <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> Metodología de Desarrollo de Software
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight">
                Ingeniería de Software & <span class="text-emerald-400">Desarrollo Ágil</span> a Medida
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
                Diseñamos, desarrollamos y escalamos soluciones digitales con arquitectura de software limpia (Clean Architecture), DevOps y estándares internacionales de calidad.
            </p>

            <!-- Metrics Badges -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto py-4 text-left">
                <div class="bg-navy-800/80 border border-navy-700 p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-emerald-400 text-xl"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Metodología</p>
                        <p class="font-bold text-sm">Scrum & Kanban</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-navy-800/80 border border-navy-700 p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-blue-400 text-xl"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Calidad</p>
                        <p class="font-bold text-sm">Clean Architecture</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-navy-800/80 border border-navy-700 p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-3 col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud text-indigo-400 text-xl"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Despliegue</p>
                        <p class="font-bold text-sm">CI/CD & Cloud</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-4 justify-center">
                <a
                    href="#contacto"
                    class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-center transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-600/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                >
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i> Cotizar Proyecto Software
                </a>
                <a
                    href="#metodologia"
                    class="border border-gray-600 hover:border-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-400 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-center transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                >
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Ver nuestra Metodología
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
